# Beat 1: a Flutter app, then `terradart init`, answering the questions.
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "terradart init"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait /numbers:/
Sleep 1.8s
Type "1"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Wait /Environments/
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Wait /for dev/
Sleep 300ms
Type "myapp-dev"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait /for prd/
Sleep 300ms
Type "myapp-prd"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait /\[y\/N\]/
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Wait /\[Y\/n\]/
Sleep 2.4s
Enter
Wait@90s /^\$\s*$/
Sleep 3s
